{
  "id": 672,
  "title": "\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc29\ud835\udc1e\u0301\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc27 \ud835\udc27\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc26\ud835\udc1e\u0301\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc2a\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc1e : \ud835\udc25\ud835\udc1e \ud835\udc12\ud835\udc1e\u0301\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc1e\u0301\ud835\udc20\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc25 \ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc1f\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc1c\ud835\udc1e \ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc27 \ud835\udc25\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc1d\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc29 \ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc27 \ud835\udc00\ud835\udc1f\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc2a\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc1e \ud835\udc1d\ud835\udc1e \ud835\udc25\u2019\ud835\udc0e\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc2d...",
  "langue": "fr",
  "description": "<p>Dakar accueille la r&eacute;union constitutive du Conseil interminist&eacute;riel du R&eacute;seau Ouest-Africain des Backbones Nationaux, pr&eacute;sid&eacute;e par le Ministre des T&eacute;l&eacute;communications et du Num&eacute;rique,\ud835\udc0c. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?id=61591400365288&amp;__cft__[0]=AZhzDLP818k19KPGBOjnUKjVcA-6IbPRy0FO3hITYr3minaEmMCAoX4hTGgV7AZE1kHC7gw3ObiCRWa5G5yDnq3QNX07JiLczXRPR1JOfuEu-ndLzA9CsnBce7fULyTEgXBRvp2G1ebz_46LkuQ95lz1Rr31k82hQPEQ-a8SNyznovtko-eZweBYklA&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\">Samba DIOUF<\/a>, en pr&eacute;sence des d&eacute;l&eacute;gations des pays membres, dont celle de la Gambie conduite par \ud835\udc0c. \ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc26\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc27 \ud835\udc09\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc01\ud835\udc01\ud835\udc08, ministre des Communications et de l&rsquo;&Eacute;conomie num&eacute;rique.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cette rencontre vise &agrave; renforcer la coop&eacute;ration sous-r&eacute;gionale, &agrave; consolider l&rsquo;ancrage institutionnel du r&eacute;seau et &agrave; d&eacute;finir une strat&eacute;gie commune pour le d&eacute;veloppement des infrastructures num&eacute;riques.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cette initiative s&rsquo;inscrit dans la dynamique du <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?id=61575546531948&amp;__cft__[0]=AZhzDLP818k19KPGBOjnUKjVcA-6IbPRy0FO3hITYr3minaEmMCAoX4hTGgV7AZE1kHC7gw3ObiCRWa5G5yDnq3QNX07JiLczXRPR1JOfuEu-ndLzA9CsnBce7fULyTEgXBRvp2G1ebz_46LkuQ95lz1Rr31k82hQPEQ-a8SNyznovtko-eZweBYklA&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\">New Deal Technologique<\/a> , qui ambitionne de faire du S&eacute;n&eacute;gal un acteur majeur de la souverainet&eacute; num&eacute;rique et de l&rsquo;int&eacute;gration num&eacute;rique africaine.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Comme l&rsquo;a soulign&eacute; le Ministre lors de son allocution d&rsquo;ouverture, la connectivit&eacute; est un levier essentiel du d&eacute;veloppement &eacute;conomique et de l&rsquo;acc&egrave;s des populations aux opportunit&eacute;s du num&eacute;rique.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mutualiser nos capacit&eacute;s, renforcer nos infrastructures et agir ensemble pour un avenir num&eacute;rique plus inclusif et plus performant en Afrique de l&rsquo;Ouest.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;\r\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\r\n<\/p>",
